  (gr_text "ASSEMBLY\n1 FACES TO DECK + END PLATE FIRST (BARE BOARDS)\n2 CLEAN (IPA)\n3 SMD PARTS, THEN J1 + J4, THEN XIAOS\n4 C1: SMD CAN OR RADIAL\n5 RP-SMAS, COAX, TIE MOUNTS\n6 POWER LEAD TO J2\n7 SWITCH INSTALLED: CUT SW1,\n   THEN CHECK SERVICE = NO POWER" (at 170 100 -90) (layer "F.SilkS") (tstamp fef4764b-de15-477b-8fc5-114fdce3b041)
